{"case_id": "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", "domain": "health", "question": "2022年至现在，命主的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱丁卯，月柱丙午，日柱乙卯，时柱壬午。日主乙木生于午月，火旺木焚，月干丙火透出，时干壬水正印调候，但壬水坐午火受克，力量不足。2022年壬寅，流年壬水透出，但寅午半合火局，火势更旺，木被泄耗严重。2023年癸卯，癸水湿木，但卯木助火，火炎土燥。2024年甲辰，甲木帮身，但辰土为湿土，与午火无直接作用，整体火土仍旺。\n\n乙木日主，火旺为病，木气被泄，易出现肝胆（木）和心血管（火）问题。时柱壬午，壬水被午火截脚，肾水不足，易有泌尿或内分泌问题。2022-2024年火土流年，加重火炎土燥，木气更弱，且午为桃花，也主血光，但无冲刑，不至于大手术。火旺克金，金主肺、大肠，但原局无金，故不直接应肺病。火旺生土，土主脾胃，但原局土弱，火多土焦，易有肠胃问题。木被火泄，肝血不足，且火旺易致肥胖（火生土，土主肌肉，但燥土不养，反为虚胖）。午为脚，火旺易有脚部炎症或静脉曲张。\n\n综合判断，火旺木衰，无大凶冲克，但健康问题集中在肝、肠胃、肥胖和脚部，符合D选项描述。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6131, "response_id": "6be575e7-4799-439b-a4c9-5bc2a8f001be", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 254, "completion_tokens": 380, "total_tokens": 634, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 254}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
